[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0010","text":"嗯，视觉相关的书，是在里面那边吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0020","text":"啊————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0030","text":"哦、哦！\n没想到会在这里碰到，真巧啊。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0040","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0050","text":"那个……嗯？\n那本书……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0060","text":"干嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0070","text":"不，我也是来找同一本书的。觉得可能会对下次拍摄有参考价值……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0080","text":"难道说，路加也是为了拍摄……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0090","text":"吵死了。\n怎么可能啊————！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0100","text":"不，不过……如果你愿意的话，可以走经费————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600200_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
